  "historyNote": "#5373, eff 4-27-92; ss by #6729, eff 4-21-98; renumbered by #10238 (from Per 102.46); renumbered by #10801 (from Per 102.47) ss by #13667, eff 6-22-23 (formerly Per 102.63); renumbered by #14065-A; renumbered by #14132-A; ss by #14434 (formerly Per 102.66), eff 12-1-25",
